      "customData": {
        "role": "text"
      },
      "text": "Docker Compose brings up the app and MySQL 5.7\ntogether for local development.\n\nThe Kubernetes manifests expect an ACR image and\nexpose a LoadBalancer service. They are committed,\nbut they are not how the app is deployed today.",
      "originalText": "Docker Compose brings up the app and MySQL 5.7\ntogether for local development.\n\nThe Kubernetes manifests expect an ACR image and\nexpose a LoadBalancer service. They are committed,\nbut they are not how the app is deployed today.",
