        "role": "text"
      },
      "text": "Dev is one EC2 instance running Docker Compose.\n\nProduction is two Azure Container Instances, each\nwith its own public DNS label, pointing at Azure\nDatabase for MySQL.",
      "originalText": "Dev is one EC2 instance running Docker Compose.\n\nProduction is two Azure Container Instances, each\nwith its own public DNS label, pointing at Azure\nDatabase for MySQL.",
